{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB早前宣布將於12月五劇齊開，全面加大劇集製作力度，而效力TVB 47年的「資深綠葉王」李成昌（昌哥），近日在社交平台上載一段行山自拍短片，向網民更新工作近況，更意外透露劇組臨時變陣，令他原本計劃好的外遊行程被迫泡湯。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:24:00.507874+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.648382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.648382+00:00","content_hash":"3cdb1eaff15010ec17732de984bd2baa103cfa916c37dfcbd8d1efad723e7196","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}